		in the system.
	</ul>
  <li> Acceptance notification: Monday, June 28, 2010
  <li> <b>Final version submission: Tuesday, August 10, 2010</b>
	<ul>
	<li> You should have received email from ACM publications: if not,
		let the Chairs know
	</ul>
  <li> Conference: October 24-29, 2010 (Sun - Fri)
</ul> 
 

